OpsPilot AI — Short Project Summary

OpsPilot AI ek AI-powered business operations automation platform hai jo n8n + PostgreSQL + AI use karke repetitive business operations ko automatically handle karta hai.

Simple flow:
Business Event
      ↓
n8n Webhook
      ↓
Data Validation
      ↓
AI Analysis
      ↓
Decision / Classification
      ↓
Automated Action
      ↓
Database + Notification
      ↓
Dashboard / Human Approval
Example:

Agar customer complain kare:

“Mera order 3 din late hai.”

OpsPilot AI:

Complaint receive karega
Data validate karega
AI issue ko analyze karega
Delivery Delay classify karega
Priority decide karega
Database mein save karega
Zaroorat par human ko approval ke liye bhejega
Automatically appropriate action lega

Goal: Ek professional autonomous operations system banana jo businesses ke repetitive workflows ko intelligently automate kare — sirf simple n8n workflows nahi, balki AI + automation + database + human-in-the-loop system.


